{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06360","headline":"送裴腾 · 李颀","name":"送裴腾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养德爲衆许，森然此丈夫。\n放情白云外，爽气连虯须。\n衡镜合知子，公心谁谓无。\n还令不得意，单马遂长驱。\n桑野蚕忙时，怜君久踟蹰。\n新晴荷卷叶，孟夏雉将雏。\n令弟爲县尹，高城汾水隅。\n相将簿领闲，倚望恒峰孤。\n香露团百草，紫梨分万株。\n归来授衣假，莫使故园芜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}